  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ANNERIE MARIA MAGDALENA WEBER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber is a prominent political figure, serving as the newly appointed Governor-General of India and a member of the National Assembly in South Africa."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW DELHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"New Delhi is the location where Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber steps out of the viceregal carriage and onto the worn stone steps of the Viceroy's House."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VICEROY'S HOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Viceroy's House is the location where Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber meets with Sir Reginald Pembroke and prepares to take on her role as Governor-General of India."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIR REGINALD PEMBROKE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sir Reginald Pembroke is the outgoing Governor-General of India, standing stiffly at attention during Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber's arrival."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUTH AFRICAN POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"South African Politics encompasses the political landscape and dynamics within South Africa, including the roles of the National Assembly and the Governor-General."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"National Assembly is the legislative body in South Africa, where Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber serves as a member and later as Governor-General of India."&lt;SEP&gt;"The National Assembly is a legislative body where Weber will take her seat and advocate for social justice and equality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH INDIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"British India is the historical context of Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber's role as Governor-General, involving complex web of alliances and rivalries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAPE TOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cape Town is the location where Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber is sworn in as a member of the National Assembly in South Africa."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BALEKA MBETE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Baleka Mbete is the Speaker of the National Assembly, welcoming Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber to the National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THEMBI SIWEYA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thembi Siweya is a community leader from Weber's constituency, praising her commitment to promoting the interests of South Africans."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDEPENDENT ELECTORAL COMMISSION OF SOUTH AFRICA (IEC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"IEC is the organization that oversees the country's electoral processes and confirms Weber's appointment to the National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUTH AFRICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"South Africa is the country where Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber serves in both the National Assembly and as Governor-General of India."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARLIAMENT OF SOUTH AFRICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Parliament of South Africa is the governing body that includes the National Assembly and the Senate, where Weber serves as a member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPEAKER OF THE NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Speaker of the National Assembly is the title held by Baleka Mbete, who welcomes Weber to the National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSTITUENCY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"constituency is the area represented by Annerie Maria Magdalena Weber in the National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"community development is the focus of Weber's work, as highlighted by Thembi Siweya."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"public service is Weber's dedication, as praised by colleagues and constituents."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIAL JUSTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"social justice is a key focus of Weber's advocacy, as mentioned in the news article."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EQUALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"equality is a core value that Weber aims to promote, as noted in the news article."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"history is the weight of expectation and legacy that Weber carries, as mentioned in the text."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"expectation is the pressure Weber faces as the first woman, first South African, and first member of the National Assembly to hold the position of Governor-General."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUTH AFRICAN PARLIAMENT'S WEBSITE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"South African Parliament's website is the source of official records confirming Weber's appointment to the National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;400 MEMBERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUMBER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"400 members is the number of people in the National Assembly, as mentioned in the news article."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEBER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Weber is appointed to a position in the National Assembly and is expected to advocate for social justice and equality."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUTH AFRICANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"South Africans are the beneficiaries of Weber's advocacy and the focus of her commitment to building a brighter future."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHANGE AND IMPROVE THE LIVES OF ALL SOUTH AFRICANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This phrase describes the goal or mission of Weber's advocacy and the overall objective of her work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIAL JUSTICE AND EQUALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"These are the core values that Weber advocates for and aims to promote."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAWMAKERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lawmakers are the members of the National Assembly where Weber will take her seat."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRIGHTER FUTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This represents the envisioned outcome of Weber's advocacy and the commitment to build a better future for South Africans."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0031</data>
    </node>
